        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Louisville, Kentucky\n- Organizations: Kentucky Exposition Center, Commonwealth of Kentucky\n- Venues: Broadbent Arena, Freedom Hall, Brown-Forman Field\n- Sports teams: Louisville Thunder, Louisville Fire\n\nFacts:\n- Broadbent Arena is a 6,600-seat multi-purpose arena in Louisville, Kentucky.\n- Freedom Hall is a multipurpose arena in Louisville, Kentucky, on the grounds of the Kentucky Exposition Center.\n- The Kentucky Exposition Center is owned by the Commonwealth of Kentucky.\n- The Louisville Thunder played its home games at Broadbent Arena.\n- The Louisville Fire was an arena football team that played its home games at Brown-Forman Field in Freedom Hall in Louisville, Kentucky.",
